# Intermediates. Everything here is rebuilt by film/build.sh from the shot
# list, the score sources and footage that is already in the tree, and it runs
# to a couple of hundred megabytes, which does not belong in a git history.
#
# Scoped to this directory rather than added to the root .gitignore so the
# film does not have to touch a file the rest of the repository shares.
.work/
.scan/
__pycache__/
